{"id":"en_hitman-at-your-service","title":"Hitman At Your Service","titleEn":"Hitman At Your Service","description":"After his father's death, Yongtae was left to cope with both poverty and lingering trauma. Matters worsen when a car accident leaves him facing a settlement offer so absurdly low that it nearly breaks him. At that low point, a mysterious figure named Yucheul appears with a dangerous proposition. With no real way to refuse, Yongtae agrees and soon finds himself testing how far he is willing to go. That single choice sets in motion a chain of events that reshapes his entire life.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/hitman-at-your-service/en_US/20cfac1c42282c79/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/hitman-at-your-service/en_US/20cfac1c42282c79/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Action","Thriller","Action & Adventure","Mystery & Thriller","Revenge & Satisfying","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsfz4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_hitman-at-your-service_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsfz4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_hitman-at-your-service_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsfz4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_hitman-at-your-service_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsfz4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_hitman-at-your-service_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dsfz4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed"